# # /ata80/
#
# Permanent identifiers for companion material to the printed book ATA80.
# The identifiers are printed in the book as QR codes, so they must keep
# resolving for decades while the hosting of the material may change.
#
# https://w3id.org/ata80/video redirects to the companion video.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
